        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>美的集团ESG报告 - 附录三</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px 60px;\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n        color: #555;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        gap: 60px;\n    }\n    .page {\n        width: 48%;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        min-height: 90vh;\n    }\n    .header-top {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #999;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        height: 20px;\n    }\n    .header-nav {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .header-nav span {\n        cursor: default;\n    }\n    .nav-active {\n        border: 1px solid #0086d9;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        padding: 2px 12px;\n        color: #0086d9;\n    }\n    .main-title {\n        font-size: 28px;\n        color: #0086d9;\n        font-weight: normal;\n        margin: 0 0 35px 0;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .subtitle-container {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .subtitle-box {\n        display: inline-block;\n        border: 1px solid #0086d9;\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        padding: 6px 24px;\n        color: #0086d9;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    th {\n        background-color: #0086d9;\n        color: #fff;\n        font-weight: normal;\n        padding: 12px 10px;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n    td {\n        padding: 14px 10px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #cce6f8;\n        vertical-align: top;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .table1 th:not(:first-child),\n    .table1 td:not(:first-child) {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n    .table2 th:last-child,\n    .table2 td:last-child {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n    .table2 td.category-col {\n        color: #0086d9;\n        width: 18%;\n    }\n    .footnotes {\n        margin-top: auto;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #999;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        padding-top: 40px;\n    }\n    .footnote-item {\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .page-number {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #999;\n        margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .page-number.right {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n    .spacer {\n        height: 63px; /* Aligns right page subtitle with left page */\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"header-top\">\n        <span>2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <h1 class=\"main-title\">附录三 关键绩效数据表</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"subtitle-container\">\n        <div class=\"subtitle-box\">温室气体排放数据</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <table class=\"table1\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>指标名称</th>\n                <th>2024年</th>\n                <th>2023年</th>\n                <th>2022年</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td>温室气体排放总量（范围1+2）<br>（吨二氧化碳当量）</td>\n                <td>2,203,472</td>\n                <td>2,298,311</td>\n                <td>1,505,877</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>温室气体排放强度<br>（吨二氧化碳当量/万元产值）</td>\n                <td>0.055</td>\n                <td>0.061</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围1²⁵温室气体排放</td>\n                <td>681,036</td>\n                <td>1,017,606</td>\n                <td>129,400</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围2²⁶温室气体排放</td>\n                <td>1,522,436</td>\n                <td>1,280,705</td>\n                <td>1,376,477</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围3²⁷温室气体排放</td>\n                <td>196,247,729</td>\n                <td>4,960,000</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围3 - 类别1采购的产品与服务</td>\n                <td>8,494,973</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围3 - 类别4 上游运输</td>\n                <td>1,340,856</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>范围3 - 类别11 已售出产品使用</td>\n                <td>186,411,900</td>\n                <td>4,960,000</td>\n                <td>/</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>温室气体排放总量（范围1+2+3）<br>（吨二氧化碳当量）</td>\n                <td>198,451,201</td>\n                <td>7,258,311</td>\n                <td>1,505,877</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n    \n    <div class=\"footnotes\">\n        <div class=\"footnote-item\">²⁵ 范围1温室气体主要来自于固定生产设备、移动源及食堂等化石能源消耗和产品制造过程中冷媒逸散等。</div>\n        <div class=\"footnote-item\">²⁶ 范围2温室气体包括外购电力、热力。以上排放源活动数据来源于费用发票、生产报表等。电力碳排放因子取自生态环境部《关于发布2022年电力二氧化碳排放因子的公告》及国际能源署《IEA Emission Factors 2022》，外购热力排放系数参考国家发展改革委《企业温室气体排放核算方法与报告指南（试行）》。采购物料的碳排放因子取自 ecoinvent 3.8数据库。其他碳排放系数参考 IPCC 2006 年《国家温室气体清单编制指南（试行）》等。</div>\n        <div class=\"footnote-item\">²⁷ 2024年度较往年范围3温室气体排放源新增统计了采购的产品与服务、上游运输，且进一步完善了已售出产品品类。</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"page-number\">143</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"header-top\" style=\"justify-content: flex-end;\">\n        <div class=\"header-nav\">\n            <span>关于本报告</span>\n            <span>走进美的</span>\n            <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n            <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n            <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n            <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n            <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-active\">附录</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"subtitle-container\">\n        <div class=\"subtitle-box\">其他环境数据</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <table class=\"table2\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th colspan=\"2\">指标名称</th>\n                <th>单位</th>\n                <th>2024年</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td rowspan=\"5\" class=\"category-col\">废气排放</td>\n                <td>废气排放总量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>388.79</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>氮氧化物（NOx）排放量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>56.58</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>硫氧化物（SOx）排放量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>45.60</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>挥发性有机化合物（VOC）</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>165.47</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>颗粒物质（PM）</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>119.99</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td rowspan=\"5\" class=\"category-col\">废弃物</td>\n                <td>有害废弃物总量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>20,451.20</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>有害废弃物强度</td>\n                <td>吨/万元产值</td>\n                <td>0.0005</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>一般固废总量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>729,790.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>一般固废强度</td>\n                <td>吨/万元产值</td>\n                <td>0.0182</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>一般固废回收利用量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>19,811.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td rowspan=\"7\" class=\"category-col\">能源使用²⁸</td>\n                <td>综合能源消耗总量</td>\n                <td>千个千瓦时</td>\n                <td>3,528,346.64</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>直接能源消耗总量</td>\n                <td>千个千瓦时</td>\n                <td>748,516.55</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>间接能源消耗总量</td>\n                <td>千个千瓦时</td>\n                <td>2,779,830.09</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>能耗强度</td>\n                <td>千个千瓦时/万元产值</td>\n                <td>0.088</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>汽油耗量</td>\n                <td>升</td>\n                <td>67,721.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>柴油耗量</td>\n                <td>升</td>\n                <td>279,583.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>压缩/管道天然气耗量</td>\n                <td>立方米</td>\n                <td>68,895,974.49</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"category-col\">水资源使用</td>\n                <td>总耗水量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>23,862,429.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>总耗水强度</td>\n                <td>吨/万元产值</td>\n                <td>0.5966</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"category-col\">包装材料使用²⁹</td>\n                <td>总使用量</td>\n                <td>吨</td>\n                <td>655,836.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>使用密度</td>\n                <td>吨/万元产值</td>\n                <td>0.0164</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n    \n    <div class=\"footnotes\">\n        <div class=\"footnote-item\">²⁸ 2024年，本集团消耗的能源类型包括固定设备燃料耗用、公务车燃油、员工食堂燃料、外购电力、外购热力，以上数据来源为相关燃料发票或生产报表；能耗系数参考国际能源署提供的转换因子以及国家《GB/T 2589-2020 综合能耗计算通则》。</div>\n        <div class=\"footnote-item\">²⁹ 包装材料包括瓦楞纸、特种纸等纸质材料。</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"page-numbe